Runtime dependencies (loaded via CDN, not bundled):

- Lenis (https://github.com/studio-freight/lenis) — MIT License
- GSAP + ScrollTrigger (https://greensock.com/gsap/) — free for personal and
  non-commercial use under the GreenSock standard "no charge" license. Commercial
  use requires a Club GreenSock license (https://greensock.com/club).

If you ship a commercial product using this kit, ensure you have the
appropriate GreenSock license or replace ScrollTrigger with a self-rolled
IntersectionObserver implementation.
